      "caveat_en": "This query catches only same-chunk span overlap. The curator's recurring Taishan dictionary headers (P09, P10) live in distinct chunks (one dictionary entry per chunk), so the actual result is 2 pairs, not the dozens one might expect from 'repeated headers'. The result is reported as measured, not adjusted to match that expectation.",
